    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wagibeoni kumkalia Joshua",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wazuri wose wikaiagha kimonu cha Jordani wiendasikira malagho gha wusimi ghwa Waisraeli, awo wose wikaiagha mighondinyi, na wurindi ghose ghwa pwani ya Bahari ya Mediterania kulangaya cha Lebanoni, awo Wahiti, Waamori, Wakanaani, Waperizi, Wahivi, na Wajebusi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wikakwana chiaimweri kwa ngolo imweri kulwa na Joshua na Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela wandu wa Gibeoni, nawo ni Wahivi, iji weresikireghe seji Joshua orebonyereghe Jeriko na Ai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wikabonya mikalo emkalia Joshua. Wikaboisa vindo vimu na kuvikumbiria andenyi ya magunia ghirashukie wikadukishira weke punda na viriba va divei vikumbilo viraka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikarwa nguwo rirashukie-rashukie na vadu vikumbilo viraka; na mkate weredwaeghe ni ghuja ghuomie ghuwadilo ni mrasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikamghendia Joshua chiaimweri na wandu wa Israeli aja kambinyi Gilgali wikamzera, “Daafuma isanga ja kula, deekunda dibonye mapatano nenyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela wandu wa Israeli wikawizera Wahivi, “Yadimika inyo ni wandu wa ahaeni kaavui, didima wada kubonya mapatano nenyo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuf. 23.32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuk. 7.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawo wikamzera Joshua, “Isi de wadumiki wako.” Joshua ukawizera, “Inyo mo weke ani? Mwafuma hao?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wikamzera, “Wadumiki wako dafuma kula na ndighi, kwa kukaia dasikire maza ra BWANA Mlungu onyu, na agho ghose ubonyere Misri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na agho orewibonyere waja wazuri wawi wa Waamori, mashariki ya Jordani. Mzuri Sihoni wa Heshboni na mzuri Ogu wa Bashani uo orekoghe ukikaia Ashtarothi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mit. 21.21-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vilongozi na wandu wose wikaiagha isangenyi mzedu, wikadizera diwade vindo vimu va charo dichekwana nenyo; dimzere angu isi de wadumiki wenyu, mpate kubonya mapatano nesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonenyi mkate ghodu, ghodeeka ghwa modo ingelo derefumagha mzedu, ela idana ghwaoma na kuwadwa ni mrasi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ivi viriba va divei vedeeka viwishi dikizoya charo, ela idana vawuya va kala na kurashuka; na iri nguwo redu na vadu vedu veerashuka kwa wundu ghwa charo kilacha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko wandu wa Israeli wikarumiria kwa wundu ghwa vindo vawo, ela ndewerelolieghe njama kwa BWANA anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua ukakaia na sere nawo, ukabonya ilaghano na awo wandu wa Gibeoni, ukawisigha wikaie moyo; vilongozi va Israeli wikabonya ighemi jekatisha ijo ilaghano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao nyuma ya matuku adadu, Waisraeli wikamanya angu awo wandu wedeeka ni wambao wa kaavui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waisraeli wikazoya kuwighendia, hata nyuma ya matuku adadu, wikavikia mizi ya awo wandu; Gibeoni, Kefira, Beerothi na Kiriath-jearimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Waisraeli ndeweredimieghe kuwibwagha anduangi, kwa kukaia vilongozi vawo werekoghe wabonya ighemi kwa irina ja BWANA Mlungu wa Israeli. Wandu wose wikawizughunukia vilongozi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela vilongozi wikatumbulia, “Damerie kubonya ighemi nawo kwa irina ja BWANA Mlungu wa Israeli, ndedidimagha kuwibonya ilagho jingi idana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suti diwisighe wikaie moyo kwa wundu ghwa iji ighemi disechekabwa ni Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vilongozi wikaghamba, “Wisighenyi wikaie moyo.” Niko awo wandu wikawuya wadumiki wedaia ijo izungu machi na kuwishoia mbande sa iji koni vilongozi wereghorieghe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua ukaduma momu awo Wagibeoni wiwango, ukawikotia, “Kwaki moredikaliagha wei mo wandu wa kula kila mo wandu wa aeni? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa wundu ughu mwawasirwa njowe, na wamu wenyu wichawuya wazumba weshoa mbande na kudaya machi kwa wundu ghwa nyumba ya Mlungu wapo matuku ghawo ghose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawo wikamtumbulia Joshua, “Ni kwa kukaia isi wadumiki wako dasikire angu Mlungu onyu kwa loli oremlaghirieghe mdumiki wake Musa kukaia uchamneka isanga iji jose, na angu waisanga wose mchawitotesha; niko isi dikaobua na ndighi hata dikabonya iji ilagho kukira marangi ghedu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana isi deko mikonunyi konyu, bonyenyi agho mmbonagha nicha kudibonyera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
